{"content":[{"c":["PETHAHIAH"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["1. Levite and ancestor of one of the postexilic priestly families (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.24.16","r":"1Chr.24.16","rawR":"1Chr.24.16","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.24.16","value":"1Chr.24.16"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 24:16"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["2. Levite who obeyed Ezra’s exhortation to divorce his pagan wife after the exile (",{"href":"?bref=Ezra.10.23","r":"Ezra.10.23","rawR":"Ezra.10.23","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ezra.10.23","value":"Ezra.10.23"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ezr 10:23"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["3. Levite who assisted Ezra at the Feast of Tabernacles (",{"href":"?bref=Neh.9.5","r":"Neh.9.5","rawR":"Neh.9.5","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.9.5","value":"Neh.9.5"}],"t":"ref","v":"Neh 9:5"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["4. Meshezabel’s son from Judah’s tribe, who served as an adviser to the Persian king (",{"href":"?bref=Neh.11.24","r":"Neh.11.24","rawR":"Neh.11.24","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.11.24","value":"Neh.11.24"}],"t":"ref","v":"Neh 11:24"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Pethahiah","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"1 Chr 24:16","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.24.16","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.24.16","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.24.16"},{"anchorText":"Ezr 10:23","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Ezra.10.23","rawQueryValue":"Ezra.10.23","sourceRefExact":"Ezra.10.23"},{"anchorText":"Neh 9:5","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Neh.9.5","rawQueryValue":"Neh.9.5","sourceRefExact":"Neh.9.5"},{"anchorText":"Neh 11:24","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Neh.11.24","rawQueryValue":"Neh.11.24","sourceRefExact":"Neh.11